       "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"CSAT Survey Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a customer satisfaction survey?\", \"a\": \"A customer satisfaction survey is a short questionnaire that asks customers to rate one product, service, or interaction and then asks why. Its headline number is CSAT, a rating on a 1-5 scale. NPS and customer effort score ask different questions and belong in separate surveys.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create a customer satisfaction survey?\", \"a\": \"Pick the moment you want to measure, such as a closed ticket or a delivered order, and the one score that fits it. Then describe the survey to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-survey-and-quiz-builder'>AI survey builder<\\/a>: the questions, who gets the link, and who hears about low scores. It builds the customer satisfaction survey form with its database and dashboard, and the free tier covers building and publishing it.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a CSAT survey?\", \"a\": \"A CSAT survey asks customers how satisfied they were with one product, service, or interaction, on a 1-5 scale, once the interaction is over. The score is the share of answers that are a 4 or a 5. Ask it once per transaction, and save the open follow-up for customers who pick a low number.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are some good questions to ask in a customer satisfaction survey?\", \"a\": \"Good questions are short and about one experience. Lead with the rating, for example \\\"How satisfied were you with your delivery?\\\" on a 1-5 scale, then ask what drove that number. Add one question you will filter results by, like the customer's plan, and one about what to fix. Keep a short customer satisfaction survey to five questions or fewer.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is an example of a CSAT survey?\", \"a\": \"A typical example runs at the end of a support chat. The customer reads \\\"Rate the help you got today\\\" and picks one of five answers, very unsatisfied at one end and very satisfied at the other. Anyone who picks 1 or 2 also gets a box to explain, and the CSAT survey saves the answer with the chat transcript and the agent.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is there a customer satisfaction survey template I can use?\", \"a\": \"Yes. A dependable template asks for one rating on a 1-5 scale and then asks for the reason in an open box. Describe the moment it follows, a delivery or a closed ticket, and Emergent builds the customer satisfaction survey template as a working survey you can edit and publish.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a B2B customer satisfaction survey?\", \"a\": \"A B2B customer satisfaction survey goes to several people at each business customer and saves every answer with the account and the person's role. Results are read by account, next to the renewal date. Sent by an agency to its clients, the same survey works as a client satisfaction survey. Emergent generates the account fields and a per-account dashboard view.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are the types of satisfaction surveys?\", \"a\": \"Satisfaction survey types are named for the score each one collects. CSAT asks for a 1-5 rating of one interaction. NPS asks how likely someone is to recommend you on a zero-to-ten scale and counts 9s and 10s as promoters. A <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-survey-and-quiz-builder/customer-effort-score'>customer effort score<\\/a> survey asks customers to rate their ease of interaction. Pick the one that matches the decision you need to make.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should customer satisfaction survey software include?\", \"a\": \"Customer satisfaction survey software should send the survey when the order or ticket closes and save each answer with the customer it came from. It should also get low scores to an owner the same day. Check whether a tool caps responses per month. Emergent builds all of it as an app with its own database and no limit on responses.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are customer satisfaction survey best practices?\", \"a\": \"Send the survey once the customer can judge it, at ticket close or a week after delivery, and stop at five questions. Put the rating first; one tap should already count as a response. For open comments with no score attached, run a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-survey-and-quiz-builder/customer-feedback'>customer feedback survey<\\/a> alongside it. Give every customer who scores 1 or 2 a named owner, and read their comments, not only the average.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
      }
     },
     {
